{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0524_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e6c8e0ca735a255c50b04a0fea6d6b5cac5ccab49ad15a6666c954ce35575f87", "ja": "（茜らしさ全開のPV撮影が終わった。\nさて、茜の様子を見に行ってみよう……）", "zh": "（充满茜风格的PV拍摄结束了。好了，去看看茜的情况吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0524_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "4960eca50005d5f82f1c44125f305bc71f4b0aa9fa36792de51b5f787b862c18", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん、スト～ップ！", "zh": "{$P$}，等～等！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0524_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "5783216ad570c4ec85c14fdd67129d0e357c4fb74cf1dd1dc9ec6c5723d3dca0", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃんの言いたいことは\nわかるよ。一言一句、カンペキにね！", "zh": "{$P$}想说的话\n我都明白哦。一字一句，丝毫不差！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0524_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "5fed4163f4fd92dffb7afc7bc21079b866effbbbabdd62a88b960f6643f4dc53", "ja": "「最高だったよ！　さすが天才美少女茜ちゃん！\n自分の予想を遥かに超えていた！」……でしょ？", "zh": "“太棒了！真不愧是天才美少女小茜！\n远远超出了我的预料！”……你想说的是这个吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0524_1005_p", "source_sha256": "8c75b1b260127f152abc8b84226ce19121b38f156d57bef97535ed970d18a714", "ja": "まあ、大体は合ってる。でも調子に乗って\n縦横無尽に走り回るのは、予想してなかったな。", "zh": "嘛，大致上都猜对了。不过你得意忘形地四处乱跑，这点我可没预料到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0524_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "bc4757e214567023c279bd0c916df2c5570a57768517b97fb95faeacc5ce7cb2", "ja": "ふっふっふっ。{$P$}ちゃんも\nまだまだ読みが甘いね！", "zh": "呵呵呵。{$P$}你还真是看得不够透彻呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0524_1007_p", "source_sha256": "24ee636560231b033b8a6cd4ac36c3b773019460c417c32cdfe86de810613c60", "ja": "そこは予想を超えてほしくなかったな……。", "zh": "我可不希望你连这点都超出预料啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0524_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "f82c39cd922b9baaa2805071af429e5272a2f876352ea35429024762e8cf031f", "ja": "人々の想像を超えていくのが茜ちゃんだからね。\nでも、その落ち着きっぷりはちょっと意外かも。", "zh": "因为小茜就是要超越人们的想象嘛。\n不过，你这副沉着的样子还真有点出乎意料。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0524_1009_p", "source_sha256": "20b82520ca059d723f8b9ee224b274e42eabdce14b71d79c6a8211fcedcf76d3", "ja": "そうか？　茜は、自分の良さを理解してるからな。\nだから今日は、茜に任せることにしたんだ。", "zh": "是吗？因为茜很了解自己的优点嘛。\n所以今天我就决定交给茜来做了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0524_1010_p", "source_sha256": "f07df78222e3258f85c05ff9dfc532d878c6c0fdf69921ff2d12f8b0cc665fea", "ja": "その方が良いものが出来る気がするし。むしろ、\nやりすぎないように見守るのが俺の役目で……。", "zh": "我觉得那样反而更有可能做出好东西。倒不如说，我的职责就是在一旁看着，免得她做得太过头……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0524_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "895803b29f342ce3210d8a2d1d66ec2de6421c7677d9820aea88e0b378086bd7", "ja": "甘い！　本当に甘いよ{$P$}ちゃん！\nとっておきのプリンよりも甘々だよ！！", "zh": "太天真了！真的太天真了，{$P$}呀！比我珍藏的布丁还要甜呢！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0524_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "dfc3536912c5b745fd49f0d8929d5d71b5311b8aa59afb8b8ff49404ec61bc89", "ja": "茜ちゃんの才能は無限大なんだよ？　それを\nやりすぎないように抑えるなんて世界の損失だよ！", "zh": "小茜的才能可是无穷无尽的哦？要压制住它，别让它发挥过头，可是全世界的损失啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0524_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "866b7e518b33694f24039153afbd0f15632affaa86233dd5c53e57a69b554a16", "ja": "やりたい放題こそが最も輝く瞬間……！　自由奔放で\n楽しくてカワイイのが茜ちゃんの魅力でしょ？", "zh": "随心所欲才是最闪耀的瞬间……！自由奔放、\n开心又可爱，不正是小茜的魅力所在吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0524_1014_p", "source_sha256": "3c68688dfeb21416446755cfd3e273a474a75ccc174f4351f9c7d14ae8f35f43", "ja": "…………。確かに。", "zh": "…………确实。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0524_1015_023aka", "source_sha256": "e7a8410060e20f3f74ffa861a832ac8bdf0b76b411a793ec1f466981c6562456", "ja": "いつも元気で明るくて怖いものナシ！\nそんな茜ちゃんがみんなをハッピーにするんだよ！", "zh": "总是元气满满、开朗活泼，什么都不怕！\n这样的小茜要让大家都开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0524_1016_p", "source_sha256": "9fa092f29acb92c7b7b54ad4288d0cee2673f0a5dbac9feb40d7175615501dcd", "ja": "……そうだな。可能性の中から、新たな魅力は\n生まれてくる。蓋をするべきじゃないよな。", "zh": "……是啊。新的魅力正是从无数可能性中诞生的。\n不该把它们扼杀掉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0524_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "44a0ed6eedc46391c16d1e0dd6548730422a82d53bfe81eb70d14694cde65941", "ja": "うんうん、わかってくれればいいんだよ☆", "zh": "嗯嗯，你明白就好啦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0524_1018_023aka", "source_sha256": "e455a89bfe587428a6f483f08da0e8d5f67ef5d2a301539f0314a4dbeeceb376", "ja": "茜ちゃんは、これからも絶対に立ち止まらない！\n天才美少女アイドルとして、さらに輝いてみせるよ！", "zh": "小茜今后绝对不会停下脚步！作为天才美少女偶像，我还会绽放出更加耀眼的光芒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0524_1019_p", "source_sha256": "8330c2f66a4acc03edfae83b7f1375d488085c23e7d940f9041394fd88740bf6", "ja": "茜……。\nああ、一緒に頑張ろ……。", "zh": "茜……。嗯，一起努力吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0524_1020_023aka", "source_sha256": "77b332d9ffed0fe6516758e7005b1e2f18c996d0138fdc40357b5fe9ee3b5483", "ja": "……となると、PV公開に合わせて、\n一味違うサプライズをやってみたいところだよね。", "zh": "……这样的话，就想配合PV公开，来个与众不同的惊喜呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0524_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "f73d656340e6e70cb8d3fa2f4555eac36d9220ac7cc60b349e864cb0fbab2aa7", "ja": "PVが終わったと見せかけて、茜ちゃんボーナスの\n動画がはじまって……うん、この突然な感じいいね♪", "zh": "假装PV已经结束，实际上却开始播放小茜奖励的\n视频……嗯，这种突如其来的感觉很棒呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0524_1022_p", "source_sha256": "ab11671eda08393ce3bfbbafbc8d472383fa72af73bc5521a58946b13623786c", "ja": "（人々をハッピーにするのが茜の原動力だ。まだ何かを\n企んでるが……できる範囲でフォローしていこう）", "zh": "（让大家开心就是茜的动力。她似乎还在谋划着什么……不过还是在力所能及的范围内配合她吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
